   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a44f9889d5006a6c02ad",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d87feaf2f6e1f1c2da5333cfaf22933a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGP-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d87feaf2f6e1f1c2da5333cfaf22933a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGP-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d87feaf2f6e1f1c2da5333cfaf22933a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGP-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d87feaf2f6e1f1c2da5333cfaf22933a?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FGP-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Gert Schmeltz Pedersen",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a44f9889d5006a6c02ad",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The class dk.defxws.fedoragsearch.server.SOAPImpl has gfindObjects() defined twice, with 7 and 8 arguments. This is the reason for the reported 'Duplicate key' error.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Alistair Young confirms that running axis2 + xmlbeans on a gsearch wsdl, where one of the gfindObjects() definitions has been removed, does not give an error.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Thus, it is axis2 + xmlbeans that cannot handle the valid definition of gfindObjects(), so there is nothing to modify in GSearch.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The further question of upgrading GSearch from axis1 to axis2 has been superficially investigated. It has not been done in Fedora, and it is a major piece of work, which seems of little benefit and therefore not further considered.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
